{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Miaotofu01/Dida-TUI/issues/38","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Miaotofu01/Dida-TUI","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Miaotofu01/Dida-TUI/issues/38/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Miaotofu01/Dida-TUI/issues/38/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Miaotofu01/Dida-TUI/issues/38/events","html_url":"https://github.com/Miaotofu01/Dida-TUI/issues/38","id":5708654333,"node_id":"I_kwDOU7m4nM8AAAABVEMm_Q","number":38,"title":"完成 ↔ 取消完成","user":{"login":"Miaotofu01","id":196646782,"node_id":"U_kgDOC7iXfg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/196646782?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Miaotofu01","html_url":"https://github.com/Miaotofu01","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Miaotofu01/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Miaotofu01/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Miaotofu01/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Miaotofu01/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Miaotofu01/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Miaotofu01/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Miaotofu01/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Miaotofu01/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Miaotofu01/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":12540536715,"node_id":"LA_kwDOU7m4nM8AAAAC63lniw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Miaotofu01/Dida-TUI/labels/ready-for-agent","name":"ready-for-agent","color":"0E8A16","default":false,"description":"Fully specified, ready for an AFK agent","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":0,"created_at":"2026-10-05T08:13:21Z","updated_at":"2026-10-05T08:17:19Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"OWNER","active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":2,"total_blocked_by":2,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"## Parent\n\n#30\n\n## What to build\n\n任务列表页按 `space` 在**完成**与**取消完成**之间切换，并立即推送。\n\n- **完成**走文档化的完成端点。\n- **取消完成**走批量更新端点的 `update` 数组带 `status: 0`。这条路径官方文档**一字未提**，是实测确认的：批量更新带 `status: 2` 能把任务完成，带 `status: 0` 能把已完成的任务改回未完成。批量更新是**合并语义**——只发 id、projectId、status，标题 / 描述 / 备注 / 优先级全部保留。**不要因为「文档没写」就把它当成不该存在的用法删掉。**\n- 完成或取消完成后给一个短暂的视觉反馈，让用户知道这一下生效了。\n- `space` **只在任务列表页生效**：输入框拿到焦点时它会被当字符吞掉、app 级绑定静默失效，而这一页没有输入框抢焦点。输入框存在时一律走 `enter` 提交。\n\n取消完成之后，**本地不能再把它算作已完成**，即使它的完成时间戳还在。\n\n## Acceptance criteria\n\n- [ ] 任务列表页按 `space` 把未完成任务标记完成，并立即推送\n- [ ] 再按 `space` 把已完成任务改回未完成，并立即推送\n- [ ] 取消完成打到批量更新端点且带 `status: 0`\n- [ ] 批量更新只发 id、projectId、status；其余字段不因这次取消完成而改变\n- [ ] 完成或取消完成后有短暂的视觉反馈\n- [ ] 取消完成后本地立刻不再把它算作已完成，即使完成时间戳还在\n- [ ] `space` 在输入框有焦点时不影响输入（该打空格就打空格）\n- [ ] 一个测试完整走通「按 `space` → 假后端收到完成调用」，另一个走通取消完成那一路\n- [ ] 有测试钉死「取消完成」的请求形状（端点 + `status: 0`）\n\n## Blocked by\n\n- #37\n- #32\n","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Miaotofu01/Dida-TUI/issues/38/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Miaotofu01/Dida-TUI/issues/38/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null}